```

RPC v11 client subscription docs, the pattern is:

```ts
const subscription = trpc.countdown.subscribe(3, {
  onData(value) {
    console.log('received:', value);
  },
  onError(err) {
    console.error(err);
  },
});
```

And to wait for completion, you can use `subscription.complete` which is a promise that resolves when the subscription is done.

